# UI/UX Overhaul: Celestial Minimal

The application has been completely transformed with a new "Celestial Minimal" design system. This overhaul focuses on premium aesthetics, weightless interactions, and ergonomic spacing.

## Key Enhancements

### 1. New Design System ([index.css](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/index.css))
- **Celestial Palette**: Deep void backgrounds with soft indigo, mint, and rose accents.
- **Typography**: Bold "Outfit" headings paired with "Inter" for high-legibility body text.
- **Glassmorphism**: Sophisticated layered effects using Vite-integrated Tailwind v4.
- **Micro-animations**: Floating elements and smooth transitions using `framer-motion`.

### 2. Premium Layout ([Layout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/components/Layout.tsx))
- **Desktop Sidebar**: Redesigned for a sense of weightlessness with increased padding, larger icons, and a real-time system status display.
- **Mobile Navigation**: A refined floating bar with improved active states and haptic-like animations.
- **Smooth Transitions**: Entire pages now glide into view with delicate opacity and translate effects.

### 3. Redesigned Planner ([PlannerPage.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/pages/planner/PlannerPage.tsx))
- **Ergonomic Daily Cards**: Day headers and meal slots are now clearly separated with generous spacing.
- **High-Contrast Meal Slots**: Improved legibility for recipe names and meal categories.
- **Intuitive Interactions**: Subtle hover states and refined "Add Meal" buttons.

### 4. Sophisticated Shopping List ([ShoppingListPage.tsx](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/pages/planner/ShoppingListPage.tsx))
- **Ledger Aesthetics**: Reimagined as a "Shopping Ledger" with high-contrast typography and elegant status indicators.
- **Interactive Inventory**: Premium toggle buttons for securing ingredients and managing stock.
- **Animated List Management**: Items smoothly transition between active and secured states.

## Verification & Proof

- [x] **Tailwind v4 Integration**: Verified Vite configuration and CSS directives.
- [x] **Component Consistency**: [Button](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/components/ui/Button.tsx#11-45) and [Card](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/components/ui/Card.tsx#11-30) components updated across the entire app.
- [x] **Responsive Design**: Layout verified for both extreme desktop and mobile viewports.
- [x] **Error Resolution**: Fixed all major TypeScript and linting regressions, including a Tailwind v4 build issue in [index.css](file:///c:/Users/mheyi/HeyinkMeals/src/index.css).

---

> [!TIP]
> The new design utilizes heavy `backdrop-blur` and `radial-gradient` effects. For the best experience, view the application on a high-refresh-rate display and ensure hardware acceleration is enabled in your browser.
